# Selfless Police Captain: "This creature enters with a +1/+1 counter on it" (a 2/2) and "When this creature leaves the battlefield, put its
# +1/+1 counters on target creature you control." Bot1 has the Captain and an Ornithopter; Bot2 has an Ornithopter of its own. Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt kills the Captain; only a creature Bot1 controls is a legal target (CR 115.1), so Bot1's Ornithopter is the one
# legal choice and is chosen without a question, and Bot2's gets nothing. It gets the Captain's counter (CR 603.10a), put on it, not
# moved: the Ornithopter becomes a 1/3.

